---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { publicEndpoint, withBase } from '../lib/urls';
const analytics=publicEndpoint(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT);
const contact=publicEndpoint(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT);
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy & accessibility — Quiet Compass" description="How preferences, drafts, optional performance data, and accessibility are handled."><section><div class="shell narrow prose"><span class="route">A clear explanation</span><h1>Your choices<br/>stay yours.</h1><h2>Preferences and drafts</h2><p>Your theme preference is saved in this browser. Project recommendations and filters can be represented in the URL. Inquiry drafts are not written to browser storage. Copying a draft or saving a text file creates a copy under your control.</p><h2>Sending a project note</h2><p>{contact?'Online inquiries are configured. Sending a note transmits your name, email, project direction, timing, and message to the inquiry service for processing and email forwarding. Only send information you are comfortable sharing for that purpose.':'Online delivery is not configured. The contact page can prepare a local brief, but it does not send an inquiry.'}</p><p>Do not include credentials, payment details, or sensitive personal information. A successful service response confirms acceptance by that service; it is not a guarantee that an email recipient has read your message.</p><h2>Optional performance sharing</h2><p>{analytics?'An optional performance endpoint is configured. Sharing is off unless you enable it here.':'No performance endpoint is configured on this deployment. This site is not sending optional performance measurements.'}</p><p>When configured and enabled, the implementation sends page paths, interaction categories, and web-performance measurements. It does not send inquiry fields or search text. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control signals disable this optional collection. The hosting provider may separately process ordinary request metadata.</p><button type="button" class="btn" data-analytics-consent aria-pressed="false" hidden>Toggle optional performance sharing</button><p class="status" data-analytics-status role="status"></p><h2>Accessibility approach</h2><p>The site is designed for keyboard navigation, clear focus, reduced motion, narrow-screen reflow, and readable content without JavaScript. Comparisons offer named states and text alternatives; forms provide field-specific errors. These are implemented practices, not a formal conformance certification.</p><p>Physical-device and assistive-technology evaluations remain part of the release checklist. <a href={withBase('contact/')}>The project-note page</a> provides a place to prepare feedback, with delivery status shown before you enter information.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
